  noticeRange: 14
  turnLine: 'Kessler: Everything I did, I did for you. For you and your brother.
    To make us RICH.|Kessler: YOU SHOULD BE THANKING ME!'
  afterTurnLine: He said it... and something TOOK him.
  defeatedLine: ...it's over. Whatever was left of him.|Behind me, in his wing, the
    safe clicks open.
